प्रसक्ता: कामभोगेषु पतन्ति नरकेऽश‍ुचौ ॥ १६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4208,\"bb\":3700,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/16/b3700/\",\"body_value\":\"aneka-citta-vibhrāntā
